  "description": "Zero-install, browser-native WebGPU phase-field laboratory uniting 2D/3D dendritic solidification (Kobayashi and quantitative Karma-Rappel with anti-trapping), 2D Folch-Plapp binary lamellar eutectic growth, 2D/3D conserved Cahn-Hilliard spinodal decomposition (NIST PFHub Benchmark 1a), foundry thermal analysis, Arrhenius-coupled Potts Monte Carlo heat treatment with opt-in T6 aging, and nine auto-verified Guided Labs.",
